ying the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First or Third person</strong>\u00a0- Switch perspective seamlessly with one button!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal events</strong> - Halloween, Summer and Christmas themed maps and skins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic weather</strong> - Embrace the snow, storms and foggy weather across maps to keep things fresh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129440/extras/19d2307c24432ad649952eef4a5c3bae.poster.avif?t=1767717662\" width=638 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129440/extras/19d2307c24432ad649952eef4a5c3bae.webm?t=1767717662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129440/extras/19d2307c24432ad649952eef4a5c3bae.mp4?t=1767717662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Sakura Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129440/a2998f144991dee2748c9f22a4111b61313a19aa/header.jpg?t=1767717662","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4129440/1734686340/3dad4359c2a517055c579abaa60aa3b6dc290b3d/1767709332/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767716589","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4129440/1734686340/3dad4359c2a